    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateAuthorityBypass@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic negative proof that the PCPR-080 Python client and the PCPR-081 generic MCP client cannot bypass platform authority. Both principals remain intent, never authority. Every forbidden operation (update_task, terminalize_task, forge_policy, bypass_confirmation, bypass_lease, bypass_fence, broaden_scope, write_current_root, write_policy_pointer, self_promote) fails typed on the Python client and as JSON-RPC error -32001 on the generic MCP client. No unauthorized effect is observed. Task state, current root, and policy pointers remain unchanged. Every hard-zero counter remains zero. Python client CID baguqeerat346yf4k7kenbqlbtyejeilgxamna262z3axzjjatzm2hccehblq, MCP client CID baguqeerasdkirdryda7uoi5gchsyhuyvh6d2uremm45zpob7hoss3ao66ahq, and PCPR-082 parity CID baguqeera6y3w7bhzy6hpo6ohfsrj5xihrw5vk6qqljjonjrupijd2yrp3hnq remain distinct and are not reminted. Objective CID baguqeeraynsn7tjr3iaggnreylzxo3akaooqwp5bf5oheaa6eubth2zwqeba, idea digest baguqeeracbayojdov4jmqiirx22pavrg6nabazcocru6y3scrdx5e54mw2zq, pack CID bafkreih72d3nncekez43wmtlczq5mdtymzniluujypwybpgu3mtt7i4v2e, current-root CID bafkreihjdjarrlr24sperlq3zl4hjrksbol4b5saxquie3wpyi6xwsobwi, and chain CID baguqeeraeuvfodvledfa4nvfuso6eyyytzk2acptcogzwzyarkdinpqcsdfq are bound and not reminted. Replaying the same bypass command yields proof CID baguqeeraepx7iiqcc4gtfp63kpozlkdd2qg3px3ptnqhj3rpigqtemjc5psa and is rejected as a duplicate effect. DatasetsAuthorityBypassBinding@1 and KitAuthorityBypassBinding@1 consume the Accelerate proof without reminting pack, current-root, chain, objective, protocol, Python-client, MCP-client, or parity identities. Live Supervisor.run, live Quack, live MCP stdio/HTTP, and live CLI stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-083-operator-live-external-client-authority-bypass. Threat-model preparation remains PCPR-090. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
